NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000274 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000275 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000276 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000277 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000278 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000279 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000280 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000281 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000282 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000283 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000284 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000285 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000286 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000287 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000288 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000289 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000290 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000291 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
